{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":845788,\"title\":\"Tales of the Bizarre: 2021 Summer Special\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"An omnibus special comprised of four segments:  >> Story 1: \\\"Ato 15 Byo de Shinu\\\" (あと15秒で死ぬ)  Pharmacist Mikami Megumi, working late, finds herself frozen in time with a bullet suspended in front of her.  >> Story 2: \\\"Sanzunokawa Outlet Park\\\" (三途の川アウトレットパーク)  Kimura Takashi wakes up near the Sanzu River, a place where he can earn \\\"virtue\\\" based on his past deeds.  >> Story 3: \\\"Deja Vu\\\" (デジャヴ)  Hikari experiences repeated déjà vu moments on her birthday, including encounters with a mysterious masked man.  >> Story 4: \\\"Naru\\\" (成る)  Famous Go player Iwaya Kentaro faces an AI opponent named \\\"Nuisance\\\" that triggers traumatic memories with its moves.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rB0V4Pc5meRdPTXysiJGH4nnaqV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whBRB7RltbW9xEbRklxeWKdOFn.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2021,\"runtime\":107,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1547747,\"name\":\"Moka Kamishiraishi\",\"character\":\"Hikari Minamino\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aBF4RdFWZbxyYVnQslgl3F5uCzR.jpg\"},{\"id\":130659,\"name\":\"Michiko Kichise\",\"character\":\"Megumi Mikami\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g4p1tUilDR4ywKq3ntwfZn8HP4k.jpg\"},{\"id\":1257419,\"name\":\"Shigeaki Kato\",\"character\":\"Takashi Kimura\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZzAOBzketeCi9dhwLpVH5v0Ful.jpg\"},{\"id\":1507843,\"name\":\"Naoki Matayoshi\",\"character\":\"Kentaro Iwaya\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xy7thIU5io0y6PrMjrzoG8FPHV8.jpg\"},{\"id\":554570,\"name\":\"Tamori\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oefePLB44xpvCw8mScc3U